WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.499
Step 1. Open the appointment. You print one appointment from Appointment Details,

1.2
00:00:05.499 --> 00:00:08.092
with its charge items and paid invoices.

1.3
00:00:08.092 --> 00:00:11.508
Open Appointment Details for the appointment.

2.1
00:00:11.508 --> 00:00:14.062
Step 2. Select Print Appointment.

2.2
00:00:14.062 --> 00:00:17.901
In Quick Actions, select Print Appointment, or press 3.

2.3
00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:21.543
Care opens the print page of the appointment.

3.1
00:00:21.543 --> 00:00:23.845
Step 3. Check the print preview.

3.2
00:00:23.845 --> 00:00:28.590
The preview shows the appointment with its charge items and paid invoices.

3.3
00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:33.129
If those fail to load, the preview still shows the appointment.

4.1
00:00:33.129 --> 00:00:36.614
Step 4. Print the appointment. Print the preview.

4.2
00:00:36.614 --> 00:00:42.329
You get a printout of the appointment, with its charge items and paid invoices.
